  "description": "CR 709.5e, 709.5h, 603.10a, 702.34a: unlocking Cadaver Lab returns a creature card from alice's graveyard to her hand, and Defiled Crypt makes a 2/2 black Horror when cards leave her graveyard, once each turn",
